#. Tag: title
#: kxsldbg_configure.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working With Options"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kxsldbg_configure.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can select zero or more options from the <guilabel>Options</guilabel> "
"dialog. Each option has a tooltip with a hint on what effect it has."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: kxsldbg_configure.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working With Parameters"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kxsldbg_configure.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can add zero or more parameters via the <guilabel>LibXSLT Parameters</"
"guilabel> section of dialog. This allows you to provide parameter values to "
"the stylesheet."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kxsldbg_configure.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For example you could add a enter a <guilabel>Parameter name</guilabel> of "
"<parameter>myparam</parameter> with a <guilabel>Parameter value</guilabel> "
"of <parameter>'Hello World!'</parameter> and click the <guibutton>Add</"
"guibutton> button. . To update the value of an existing parameter just use "
"the navigate to the value you wish to change with the <guibutton>Prev</"
"guibutton> or <guibutton>Next</guibutton> button, provide a new "
"<guilabel>Parameter value</guilabel> then click the <guibutton>Apply</"
"guibutton>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: kxsldbg_configure.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Apply Changes"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kxsldbg_configure.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For the changes you have made to take effect press the <guibutton>Apply</"
"guibutton> button. To ignore any changes press the <guibutton>Cancel</"
"guibutton> button."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kxsldbg_configure.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can close the dialog using the <guibutton>X</guibutton> provided at the "
"top right of the window. If you need to change the configuration just re-"
"open the configuration dialog as shown before."
msgstr ""

